# Secrets live in Infisical (project: starterkit). This file only lists key names; never commit real values.
# Infisical dashboard: https://app.infisical.com  (docs: https://infisical.com/docs/documentation/getting-started/introduction)
#
# Two ways to get a working .env:
#   1. Infisical:   `infisical login`, then `pnpm secrets:seed dev` fills what it can generate
#                   and lists the rest (see packages/env/README.md).
#   2. No accounts: `pnpm setup:local` writes a root .env for running on one machine.
#
# GENERATED by `pnpm env:example` from the key definitions. Do not edit by hand.

# --- Infisical path: /api ---

# development | test | production. Defaults to development. Optional.
NODE_ENV=

# Set to 1 to skip validation, for CI builds that have no secrets. Never in production. Optional.
SKIP_ENV_VALIDATION=
